          text: `"Who are you when you're at your best?" \u2014 Answer without editing. Most people start with a disclaimer ("that's a hard question"), list three adjectives, then apologise for the answer. That structure is the finding. Notice you reached for traits instead of an incident; the version of this answer that lands is a ten-second scene, not a character reference.`
