        mistake: "Judging the timbre of your voice rather than the habits inside it. Almost everyone hates their recorded voice on day one \u2014 that reaction is universal, meaningless, and the fastest way to quit. You are not listening for whether you sound attractive. You are counting pauses, fillers and landings.",
