        headline: "One story that survives retelling",
        why: "You need exactly one story about yourself that other people can retell in two sentences, because your reputation is built almost entirely out of other people's retellings when you are not in the room. A story that can be compressed and repeated travels; a story that only works in your own voice does not. This is why the most memorable people often have a small number of highly polished stories rather than a large number of anecdotes.",
