          "In delivery, range does three jobs. It marks the end of a point (pitch drops). It signals a question or an invitation (pitch rises at the end). And it distinguishes your key sentence from the scaffolding around it \u2014 if everything is at the same pitch, nothing is emphasised and the listener has to guess what mattered.",
