          'The clean version tells the truth without a case for the prosecution: what is ending, that it is a decision rather than a punishment, and \u2014 importantly \u2014 that there is nothing they can fix. "You have not done something wrong that you can fix" is often the most useful sentence in the conversation, because otherwise they will spend a month looking for the mistake.',
