        body: 'A repair has four beats and most people only attempt the first. Say the behaviour specifically, name the effect as theirs, say what changes, then stop talking. The "but" appended to an apology is the sentence that undoes it.',
        use: "You missed something, snapped at someone, or found out a decision landed badly."
