        body: 'Warmth, then the line, then a door \u2014 three beats, and the middle one is the only one anybody practises. The line is a position, not a feeling and not a question: "I am not able to do that" holds; "I would rather not, if that is okay?" invites a rebuttal.',
        use: "Family requests, friends who over-ask, colleagues who escalate politely."
