        source: "Charisma Lab",
        tags: ["awkwardness", "repair", "silence", "misreading"],
        title: "The One-Sentence Reference",
        short: "Close the loop before it grows.",
        body: 'After a small awkwardness, the repair is not an apology \u2014 it is a reference: "I have been thinking about what I said on Tuesday and I think it landed badly." The awkwardness has already faded; the unfinished sentence in their head has not.',
        use: "A joke that missed, a decision made without somebody, a compliment that sounded like a slight."
